{"id":"n82634-4-7","stage":4,"title":"틀어박히다 · 被搁置","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82634-4-7-1","ko":"목도리는 찾았어?","zh":"找到围巾了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목도리는","meaning":"围巾","explanation":"목도리：围巾；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"목도리","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55854","senseId":"1","lemma":"목도리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목도리는","audio":"/audio/d35f0336948032f4f6b1.mp3"}},{"text":"찾았어?","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾았어","audio":"/audio/f93e06434e437a206141.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"634f23a72357e402","term":"목도리","zh":"围巾","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3","entryId":"55854","definition":"为了抵御寒冷而围在脖子上的用品。","pronunciation":["목또리"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c07f29985a26b833f6b5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82634-4-7-2","ko":"아니, 대체 어디에 틀어박혔는지 아무리 찾아도 없네.","zh":"没有，不管怎么找都找不到，真不知道它到底藏到哪儿去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니,","meaning":"不，没","explanation":"아니：不，没","readings":[{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65980","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니","audio":"/audio/bcf26f704fdac00f644a.mp3"}},{"text":"대체","meaning":"到底、究竟","explanation":"대체：到底、究竟","readings":[{"term":"대체","audio":"/audio/baa66ff689021a3fd29e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:대체:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"대체","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대체","audio":"/